WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.160
Dr. Ramírez,

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.200
I don't understand this.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.160
Okay.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.680
No need to keep showing me this.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.960
It's all clear.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.080
Miss Rose, I'm certain

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.360
all your test results were forged.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.440
What?

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.680
I think it was your ex's doing.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.240
Why would he do that?

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.280
I don't even care

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.560
about his motives.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.200
We've got more important

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.600
things to worry about.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:37.480
Actually, this just

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.840
confirms my suspicions.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.800
What do you mean?

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.920
About Spencer and your mother.
